---

## List Tracks

```
GET /tracks
```

Returns a paginated list of tracks.

### Query Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `offset` | integer | `0` | Items to skip |
| `limit` | integer | `20` | Items per page |

### Response

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "title": "Track Title",
      "slug": "track-title",
      "artist_id": "uuid",
      "album_id": "uuid",
      "audio_url": "https://...",
      "cover_url": "https://...",
      "duration": 240,
      "source": "youtube",
      "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "total": 100
}
```

## Get Track

```
GET /tracks/:id
```

Returns a single track by ID.

## Get Random Tracks

```
GET /tracks/random
```

Returns a random selection of tracks.

## Count Tracks

```
GET /tracks/count
```

Returns the total number of tracks in the database.

## Create Track

```
POST /tracks
```

Creates a new track. Requires authentication.

## Update Track

```
PUT /tracks/:id
```

Updates an existing track. Requires authentication.

## Delete Track

```
DELETE /tracks/:id
```

Deletes a track. Requires authentication.
